ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N3HmE4DStZ0Q7kNvwE520Zk&_nc_oc=AdqE7EyQV-bDlmfCfnU0IfsM8EApptiLJ7EMwB3GIDezt_do0QwYkCF59d7nB-3FVVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Cnl4MiIU9oBtkCaTFGLhk8Te_DizBUBn1_6b_ogMkwA&oe=6A258C7C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vy_tV0lMfAIQ7kNvwGFVu7y&_nc_oc=Adqs8ZwXvPbl29vHPDWXAIayMlvF6yiBtBDHMGVznUvjM-3W9V7fWe6k7qatywUjkUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8TYA3aypSMULtZeLP8p4t6qvlrNvbjEHCrD31dXH38dA&oe=6A257096"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0kScalyaFnwQ7kNvwE8wjn-&_nc_oc=Adr7YZmsVnXObByTAnes45igixfWItuaCDhyNNQT0dFanVEJda9GxObaP-SVBOs0_zA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9M1cGDbSbkroODJKMQbf8jq_2OQbwKhG9ZkdP7oWkG2w&oe=6A257E64"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_